<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">6-Step Actuarial Valuation Process in Mumbai</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Walk-in at Patron's Marine Lines office. Actuarial valuation coordinated with qualified actuaries + CA-led data validation, accounting, and audit support.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
